{"key":"moment:4381859","id":"4381859","kind":"moment","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"b5a300c55ca321b3fca782fb"},"time":1735706508936,"text":"新的一年新的开始，不管大家身在何处，收入几何，是否有伴，这些都并非评价准则。做一个心底充满能量的人，充满自信的的人，充满爱的人。不为他人裹挟，也不强求他人，好好做自己，爱自己，并把爱外溢与周围的人，也不求溢出后的的回报。这便是智。\n于理想，有时候迈出那第一步，就可以一冲到底。2025年，希望大家都有属于自己的第一步。对所追求的不求回报努力付出，这便是爱。\n有一句话叫爱会流向不缺乏爱的人，因为他们自身充满爱的质量。愿大家都拥有属于自己的智与爱，因为爱一直都在～[emot=acfun,1658/]","title":"","images":["db7ff0fc2711e134169fe5bb"],"cover":"","duration":"","views":0,"counts":{"commentCount":76,"likeCount":401,"bananaCount":331,"shareCount":3},"url":"https://m.acfun.cn/communityCircle/moment/4381859","archivedComments":73,"archivedRoots":71,"commentPages":["comments/4381859/all/1.json","comments/4381859/all/2.json","comments/4381859/all/3.json","comments/4381859/all/4.json"],"hotPages":["comments/4381859/hot/1.json"],"threads":{"801447104":{"pages":["comments/4381859/threads/801447104/1.json"],"savedReplies":1,"reportedReplies":1,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"801447104","root":"801447104","user":{"id":"14335477","name":"小勒个朵","avatar":"dbaf8380bb5d03682e5f8ab0"},"text":"新年快乐我水姐~","time":1735710231830,"floor":40,"likes":3,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":false}},"801446771":{"pages":["comments/4381859/threads/801446771/1.json"],"savedReplies":1,"reportedReplies":1,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"801446771","root":"801446771","user":{"id":"1504445","name":"科普卢星区界外魔","avatar":"73177817ab76e696488b519b"},"text":"今天是2025年1月1日，星期三\r\n请各位肥肥于晚间七点在水曜日直播间集合\r\n2025第一天就是水曜日歌回，好！","time":1735708122857,"floor":26,"likes":54,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":true}}},"hotCount":1}